    {
      "id": "sol.amc-10-2001-p3.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Let the numbers be \\(a\\) and \\(b,\\) so \\(a+b=S.\\) After adding \\(3\\) to each and doubling, the sum is \\(2(a+3)\\) \\(+2(b+3)\\) \\(=2(a+b)+12\\) \\(=2S+12.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is E.",
      "hints": [
        "Call the numbers \\(a\\) and \\(b\\) with \\(a+b=S\\)",
        "The final sum is \\(2(a+3)+2(b+3)\\)"
